摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Plugin and Agent Profile Package Index - Install dsh-plugin with just one command","id":"gh:1333208771","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-index","slug":"Sunrisepeak/dsh-index","topics":["agent","deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","package-index","xlings","xpkg"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Plugin and Agent Profile Package Index - Install dsh-plugin with just one command"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-index"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Agent = Harness + Plugins/Packages.** This index browses, and distributes,\nboth — the plugins of t"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"he DeepSeek Harness\necosystem, and complete Agents assembled from them."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Browse everything at **<https://sunrisepeak.github.io/dsh-index>**."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What this is"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**1 · A browser for the ecosystem.** Every dsh plugin worth installing, searchable,\nwith what it doe"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"s, where its bytes come from, and how the ecosystem has grown\nover time."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**2 · One command to install, two ways to run it.** dsh installs plugins itself,\nso every plugin pag"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"e leads with its native command. This index's command sits\nbelow it and adds what dsh cannot: a sha2"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"56-checked tarball and a CN mirror."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**3 · A distribution channel for Agents.** `Agent = Harness + Plugins/Packages`\n— in dsh's own model"},{"id":"p9s2","text":", a *profile*. Here each one is a single xpkg descriptor, so\n`xlings install` resolves the members, "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"installs them, writes the profile, and\n**registers a command named after the package**. One install,"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"tes the profile, and\n**registers a command named after the package**. One install, one word to type:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The profile name is the package name too, so `dsh --profile agent-web-coding`\nis the same thing spel"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"is the package name too, so `dsh --profile agent-web-coding`\nis the same thing spelled the long way."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"That last line is not a typo. **Installing an Agent leaves you a command named\nafter it**, registere"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"d through xlings' `xvm` as an alias onto\n`dsh --profile agent-web-coding`. Because the name is xvm's"},{"id":"p14s3","text":", it is versioned\nand scoped per subos for free:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"`dsh --profile agent-web-coding` keeps working — the command is an alias, not\na replacement."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Don't have xlings yet? Click for the install command"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Linux / macOS**"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Windows — PowerShell**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> More about xlings → xlings.d2learn.org"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Three tiers"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| tier | what it is | installing it |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| **plugin** | one upstream bundle — an atom | downloads and pins the bytes, and prints the one line"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" that composes it |\n| **group** | a reusable set that composes cleanly | installs every member |\n| *"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"*Agent** | `Harness + Plugins` + this Agent's own config layer | creates its profile, composes every"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"thing into it, and registers a command named after the package |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"A group and an Agent carry no bytes of their own. They are manifests a few\nhundred bytes long; the m"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"embers hold the payload. Members are required to be\nmirrored, because a curated set whose contents f"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"etch from upstream at boot\nwould inherit every failure mode the mirror exists to remove."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Why an Agent has to be a package, and not just a YAML file"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"dsh composes a profile from four patch layers, and you can hand it another one\nat boot:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"But a patch carries configuration only — **no dependency declarations** — and\ndsh's boot path never "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"invokes a package manager. Point it at a patch naming a\nplugin you do not have and it exits:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The profile's `package.json` is what carries dependencies, and that is what\n`pnpm install` reads. So"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" distributing an Agent needs something that installs —\nwhich is precisely what an xpkg's `deps` clos"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"n Agent needs something that installs —\nwhich is precisely what an xpkg's `deps` closure already is."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Installing"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Every plugin page shows both commands. They are not equivalent:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The native spec differs per package and is resolved when the site is built,\nnever guessed: a bundle "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"npm actually serves at our pinned version installs by\nname, and everything else installs from its pi"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"nned commit. Today that is 17\nby name and 51 by commit — a bare `bundle_name` is the package's own\n`"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"package.json` name and does not imply publication."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"All the commands you need — install, switch, remove"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"`XIM_DSH_PROFILE` is this index's variable, deliberately not spelled\n`DSH_PROFILE`: dsh reads no suc"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"h variable — only `DSH_HOME`, `DSH_WEB_URL`\nand `DSH_TELEMETRY_DISABLED` — so using that name would "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"claim an upstream\ncontract that does not exist."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Where did my plugin go? (and how to launch it)"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Installing prints the answer, but the rule is:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Installing a plugin does not put it in a profile.** Fetching and composing\nare separate acts with "},{"id":"p42s2","text":"separate owners, so the atom fetches and prints the one\nline that composes it:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"While the atom registered itself, installing one Agent also put its five\nmembers in `web`, because e"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"ach member had already decided where it belonged\nbefore the Agent ran."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"| What you installed | Profile | Launch |"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"| an Agent | its own package name — composed for you | `dsh --profile <package-name>` |\n| a group | "},{"id":"p46s2","text":"none; its members are fetched, not composed | — |\n| one plugin | none until you paste the printed li"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"ne | `dsh web`, or `dsh --profile <name>` |"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"The profile in that printed line is the one the plugin's own README documents\n(65 say `web`, 2 say `"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"tui`, 1 says `cc-tui`) — this index does not invent\nnames, and any name works. An Agent uses its own"},{"id":"p47s3","text":" package name, so\n`xlings install dsh:X` is always followed by `dsh --profile X`; two names for\none "},{"id":"p47s4","text":"thing would leave a reader no way to know they are related."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"## Mirrored vs direct"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Every plugin is one of two kinds, and the site labels which:"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"| | mirrored | direct |"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"| bytes come from | xlings-res, sha256-checked | GitHub, at a pinned commit |\n| CN mirror | yes | no"},{"id":"p52s2","text":" |\n| upstream deletes the repo | still installable | gone |\n| ships a `prepare` script | built in th"},{"id":"p52s3","text":"is index's CI | pnpm blocks it until you allow it |"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"**The licence decides**, not a preference: mirroring is redistribution. Of the\n169 bundles surveyed "},{"id":"p53s2","text":"across the `dsh-plugin` topic, 29 ship no LICENSE at all\nand 13 more are unclassifiable — this index"},{"id":"p53s3","text":" has no right to mirror those, so\nthey stay direct and say so."},{"id":"p54s1","text":"## Defining an Agent"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"This is the contribution that matters most here: **compose plugins that already\nexist into something"},{"id":"p55s2","text":" someone can run.** An Agent is a manifest — a few hundred\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
